 Many do not: the middle two-bedroom listing, counting listings open only part of the year, keeps about $3,000 a year less than a lease after running costs.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A listing at the top-quarter mark, run all year, keeps about $12,000 more than the lease. Most traditional neighborhoods inside Myrtle Beach city limits are not zoned for stays under 90 days, so there a lease is the choice.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Send us one address. We run it both ways before you offer.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Get both numbers</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#which-earns-more" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Which earns more</a></li><li><a href="#is-it-allowed" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Is it allowed</a></li><li><a href="#break-even" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Nights to break even</a></li><li><a href="#month-by-month" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Month by month</a></li><li><a href="#year-round" style="display:block;padding:.65r