 href="/airbnb-data/united-states/north-carolina/morehead-city" class="min-w-0 text-[15px] font-bold text-[#0077cc] hover:underline truncate"> Morehead City Airbnb data </a> <span class="shrink-0 text-[13.5px] tabular-nums text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">NC · $254/night · 37.1%</span> </li> </ul></div></div>  </div> </section> <section id="faq" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> FAQ </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> Myrtle Beach Airbnb FAQ </h2>  </div> <div class="border-t border-[#e0e0e0] font-lato"> <details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]" open> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much do Airbnb hosts make in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>An active Myrtle Beach Airbnb grossed $25,807 on average in the 12 months to September 2026, according to AirROI's tracking of 8,698 active listings. That is before cleaning, management, taxes and financing. Busier, better-run listings do far better: the top quarter took in $4,330 or more in a typical month.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]" open> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much can I make on Airbnb in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>It depends most on the home's size, location and how it's run. The middle half of Myrtle Beach listings earn between $1,270 and $4,330 in a typical month, and the top tenth $6,770 or more. For one home, enter its address and bedroom count in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb income calculator</a>: it compares the home with similar listings nearby.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the average Airbnb occupancy rate in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Listings in Myrtle Beach were booked on 36% of available nights over the past year. That compares with 39% for the South Carolina average. July is usually the busiest month.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much does an Airbnb cost per night in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average booked night in Myrtle Beach cost $257 before fees. Half of listings charge between $160 and $285, so bedroom count and location move the price more than the average suggests.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Do you need a permit for an Airbnb in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Yes, in the zones that allow stays under 90 days, with a City of Myrtle Beach business license; most residential neighborhoods are closed to short-term rentals. The <a href="/airbnb-data/united-states/south-carolina/myrtle-beach/regulations" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Myrtle Beach Airbnb regulations</a> set out the permit, its cost, the taxes on a stay and the operating limits, each linked to its official source.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Is Airbnb profitable in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Yes, when it's run well. The average Myrtle Beach Airbnb grossed $25,807 in the 12 months to September 2026, 31% below the South Carolina average of $37,525. Run by its owner, with the cleaning fee covering the cleaner and everyday costs for Airbnb's fee, utilities, supplies, upkeep and insurance, $15,977 a year (about $1,330 a month) is left before the mortgage or rent. A home that costs less than that to own or rent makes a profit, and a listing at the top-quarter mark leaves about $2,310 a month. Check a specific home in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb estimator</a>.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>When is Airbnb peak season in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>July usually pays best, averaging $6,800 per active listing over the past two years, and January usually pays least. The month-by-month table above shows how the latest 12 months played out.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the Airbnb RevPAR in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Each night a Myrtle Beach listing was open to book earned $106 on average over the past year, booked or not. That figure, revenue per available night (RevPAR), folds price and occupancy into one number; the top 10% of listings made $204 or more.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How far in advance do guests book Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Myrtle Beach stays were booked 52 days (about seven weeks) before arrival on average over the past year, so most of a month is booked well before it starts.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How long do guests stay at Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average Myrtle Beach Airbnb stay lasted 4.7 nights over the past year. A listing took 19 reservations over the year on average.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How are Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach rated?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Guests rate Myrtle Beach Airbnbs 4.66 out of 5 on average. Guests score location highest and cleanliness lowest.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What are the best neighborhoods for Airbnb in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Broadway at the Beach, Myrtle Beach Boardwalk and Promenade and West Myrtle Beach draw the most short-term rental interest in Myrtle Beach. The <a href="#neighborhoods" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">neighborhood guide</a> explains what brings guests to each.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How many Airbnbs are there in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>AirROI counted 8,698 active Airbnb listings in Myrtle Beach as of September 2026. The closest tracked market is <a href="/airbnb-data/united-states/south-carolina/fantasy-harbour" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Fantasy Harbour</a>, 5 km away.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much are Airbnb cleaning fees in Myrtle Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>In Myrtle Beach, about nine in ten listings add a cleaning fee, and the typical fee is about $151.</p> </div> </details> </div> </section><section id="about-data" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Method </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> About This Data </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div class="space-y-4"> <p id="about-data-summary">
+Figures on this page cover <strong>8,698 active Airbnb listings</strong> in Myrtle Beach from <strong>October 2025</strong> to <strong>September 2026</strong> (trailing twelve months). AirROI
+    refreshes them monthly from listing-level booking and calendar data covering 20+ million properties worldwide. Money figures are in U.S. dollars. Annual revenue averages every listing active during the period, including those listed for only part of it; monthly
+    figures average the listings active in each month; the tier lists show the spread. Neighborhood descriptions are AI-assisted.
+    See the  <a href="/data-portal/methodology">methodology</a> for definitions.
